          <div class="label _30-margin">Aromatherapy &bull; Ayurveda</div>
          <h1 class="heading1specialabout page-intro__title">Ayurvedic Candles</h1>
          <p class="page-intro__lead">Aromatherapy is a holistic practice that helps bring balance to body and mind, and recognises that our sensory experiences determine the quality of our thoughts and emotions. According to Ayurveda, our sense of smell can balance or disrupt the doshas which directly affect our health and well-being.</p>
          <p class="page-intro__text">In Ayurvedic medicine, doshas are referred to as biological energies. These are found throughout the human body and govern all your mental and physical processes, playing a part in your mood and energy levels.</p>
          <p class="page-intro__text">These foundational energies are derived from the five elements and their associated properties. Vata is linked to the qualities of air and space, while Pitta reflects fire and water. Kapha represents an essential energy with qualities related to earth and water.</p>
          <p class="page-intro__text">Mindfully created, these candles have been handcrafted to balance our dominant dosha and bring harmony to our well-being. Made from natural coconut and soy wax, blended with essential and botanical oils, ensuring a clean and even burn that can last for up to 35 hours.</p>
